SEC. 51P-1114.109. CONTRACTOR'S MAINTENANCE YARD.

(a) The following equipment is prohibited:

(1) Backhoe-loaders;

(2) Bulldozers;

(3) Compactors/rollers;

(4) Concrete mixers;

(5) Dump trucks;

(6) Excavator;

(7) Front-end loaders exceeding 2,500 pound bucket capacity;

(8) Graders;

(9) Mobile cranes; and

(10) Non-electric forklifts.

(b) Outside storage of piles of unwrapped and uncovered compost, mulch, soil, gravel, and sand are prohibited.

(c) Retail sales are prohibited. (Ord. 32814)
